<title>UK: LIFFE coffee, cocoa end easier, sugar mixed.</title>
<headline>LIFFE coffee, cocoa end easier, sugar mixed.</headline>
<text>
<p>COFFEE - Jan up but others end softer as correction continues with underlying support. March flat at $1,475.</p>
<p>COCOA - Touch easier after failing to break resistance above 900. March down one stg at 894.</p>
<p>SUGAR - Mixed and trading in a narrow range. March unchanged at $298.10 at 1704 GMT.</p>
</text>
